    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcuffed to a bizzare arcade machine with a revolver locked on your skull, you're forced to play a deadly game where failure means death.\u00a0The machine's screen flickers to life, revealing Diemon, a menacing floating dice with glowing eyes, who forces you to play\u00a0a deadly top-down shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/extras/7898a3af90389d3296361ce14dd25320.poster.avif?t=1755069735\" width=600 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/extras/7898a3af90389d3296361ce14dd25320.webm?t=1755069735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/extras/7898a3af90389d3296361ce14dd25320.mp4?t=1755069735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insert dice into the arcade machine to load your weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in the flickering light of an abandoned building's decaying restroom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard raw techno pounds from the room's speakers as red lights pulse with the bass, creating a nightmarish soundtrack to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sentry gun revolver tracks your mistakes. Fail too often and it fires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Buckshot Roulette &amp;\u00a0Hotline Miami.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you escape or will you become another victim of the machine?</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcuffed to a bizzare arcade machine with a revolver locked on your skull, you're forced to play a deadly game where failure means death.\u00a0The machine's screen flickers to life, revealing Diemon, a menacing floating dice with glowing eyes, who forces you to play\u00a0a deadly top-down shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/extras/7898a3af90389d3296361ce14dd25320.poster.avif?t=1755069735\" width=600 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/extras/7898a3af90389d3296361ce14dd25320.webm?t=1755069735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/extras/7898a3af90389d3296361ce14dd25320.mp4?t=1755069735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insert dice into the arcade machine to load your weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in the flickering light of an abandoned building's decaying restroom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard raw techno pounds from the room's speakers as red lights pulse with the bass, creating a nightmarish soundtrack to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sentry gun revolver tracks your mistakes. Fail too often and it fires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Buckshot Roulette &amp;\u00a0Hotline Miami.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you escape or will you become another victim of the machine?</h2>",
